{"vid": 340791361, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 13, "reviews": [{"range": "4208-4264", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_87ThV3a0f", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "库存周期开始回落的初期虽然需求已经开始走弱，但企业之前为了应对景气阶段而扩大的生产还在惯性延续，供给调整滞后于需求，商品价格会因为前期成本推动、供给刚性以及货币存量的影响依然维持在高位甚至继续上行，形成经济下行但价格上涨的滞胀状态。而随着时间推移需求持续走弱的压力会彻底显现，企业开始真正意识到需求衰退并大规模主动减产、去库存，供给快速收缩但需求回落更快，商品价格会从高位快速下跌，物价水平持续走低，经济就从滞胀转向通缩。在通缩环境下企业产品价格不断下跌，盈利会持续恶化，同时债务的实际负担加重，全社会信用收缩、流动性趋紧，风险偏好大幅下降，这是股市最不利的宏观环境，几乎没有牛市的可能。\n\n库存周期四个阶段（基钦周期）\n1. 被动去库存：需求上升，库存下降\n经济刚开始复苏，需求突然变好，但企业还没反应过来，没来得及扩大生产，库存被快速消耗掉。\n例：2016年一季度供给侧改革后需求回暖，工厂订单突然增多，但企业还没增产，货架上的货越卖越少，这就是典型被动去库存。\n2. 主动补库存：需求上升，库存上升\n企业确认需求真的好了，开始大规模扩产、备货，主动增加库存，迎接市场增长。\n例：2016年下半年到2017年企业看到销量持续上涨纷纷开足马力生产、囤原料，库存和需求一起涨，这是库存周期最强、经济最好的阶段。\n3. 被动补库存：需求下降，库存上升\n需求开始变差卖不动了，但企业还在按之前的计划生产，货卖不出去，库存被动积压。\n例：2018年上半年需求已经走弱，但企业惯性生产，导致产品大量堆在仓库，这就是周期见顶、即将衰退的信号。\n4. 主动去库存：需求下降，库存下降\n企业意识到需求不行了开始主动减产、清库存、收缩生产，经济进入下行压力最大的阶段。\n例：2014年底-2015年房地产下行，企业大量减产、去库存，经济压力最大，这就是主动去库存。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "我们认为2015年的库存周期下降为先滞胀后通缩，而按照我们对周期的理解，从滞胀向通缩的转换大概率会出现在第二季度", "range": "4208-4264", "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "254854030_87ThV3a0f", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774512577, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 16}]}, {"range": "4292-4343", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "55187530_8aapu62ba", "review": {"abstract": "2015年的核心风险点可能在第二季度左右。\n如", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "2026呢？感觉现在美元也在走强，好可怕", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "4292-4343", "createTime": 1782528341, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "55187530_8aapu62ba", "userVid": 55187530, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 55187530, "name": "加油 ", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ajNVdqHZLLBS2sCvPNM2ToQeZ5kco1tqicT0ia5me1ibw3bibzfnDcQvfibgNLTBfq9ibKDRHH4GY9wpzObUfpfoib9OA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}}}]}, {"range": "4423-4438", "bookMarkCount": 126, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 8, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "13294121_8b2x16rdg", "review": {"abstract": "康波衰退向来以两次危机来完成。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "A浪下跌，B浪反弹，C浪下跌确认，极速崩溃。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "4423-4438", "createTime": 1785602454, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "13294121_8b2x16rdg", "userVid": 13294121, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 13294121, "name": "夏然", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIeMI778aXNaPMkgDBdmvWRXYyu1E4FN1IwQuK4rVkNMcUNbQR2vUiah5cF6APuvUo1xGiaP5HLGcOg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}}}, {"reviewId": "239932584_896kgC1Q9", "review": {"abstract": "康波衰退向来以两次危机来完成。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "所以等待衰退的第二次危机，关注美元强势，资源国压力的时候，就可以入场，或许不一定完全能抄到最低底，但是这时候就可以进行建仓伏笔。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "4423-4438", "createTime": 1778774746, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "239932584_896kgC1Q9", "userVid": 239932584, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 239932584, "name": "子橘", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/OUicWJdJoz3HJ0bq9GbaiajG8UnprHodQ7wlA5CwiaxBgvogm23hGiaD9ic7WBHlxibhyAuzItvsLdJNI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "子橘", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}, "likesCount": 4, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "442224903_84PDBl6Bd", "review": {"abstract": "康波衰退向来以两次危机来完成。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "08  15", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4423-4438", "createTime": 1763740396, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "442224903_84PDBl6Bd", "userVid": 442224903, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 442224903, "name": "杰渔", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/JN58ZxOzJPsWY3bysdiafO8ibJibCoIc1icict9BwBvYsDjs87nDKvWTp61gQZ3HnnjKAjmjWgLia0kq2ULTdzBSuUGBMAeYMMXSX8n0nvw0RMbc8/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20250303-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "254854030_87TiccIOt", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "每一轮康波周期的衰退阶段必须经历两次冲击才能彻底完成康波从衰退走向萧条的切换，这是历史上每一轮康波都反复出现的规律。第一次危机通常发生在康波繁荣结束、衰退刚开始的时候，一般是由资产泡沫破裂、流动性收紧引发的局部性危机，主要作用是刺破前期的繁荣泡沫，让经济进入收敛状态。第二次危机则是康波衰退的终极冲击，发生在收敛假象被打破、经济向下突破的阶段，它往往由全球周期共振回落、强势美元、资源国崩溃、债务出清共同引发，是一次更彻底更全面的出清。只有经历这第二次危机的冲击，康波衰退才算真正完成，全球资产价格才会跌出真正的底部，后面的大机会才会到来。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "康波衰退向来以两次危机来完成", "range": "4423-4437", "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "254854030_87TiccIOt", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774512831, "userEditTime": 1776599253, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 23, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "292501627_834DH3HgG", "review": {"abstract": "康波衰退向来以两次危机来完成。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterUid": 13, "content": "第一次衰退人们可能还是不能反思旧有思想的，二次衰退让人打破幻想。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "第一次衰退人们可能还是不能反思旧有思想的，二次衰退让人打破幻想。", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4423-4438", "createTime": 1757549255, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "292501627_834DH3HgG", "userVid": 292501627, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1757549291, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "author": {"userVid": 292501627, "name": "钙片", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/BN0Qj4V3qa5R5Qt0V4bZLibgnRgwQ3XnnbYIoZVVHbibWpqOxv54uKRsLicADfjlS0TmlAiccru2DStLFAmz0cItYzicymE2YMsLwzax80FYGvLI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "钙片", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "3104481_8cWF4YxXY", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "根据康波周期理论，第五次康波衰退的第一次危机是2008年爆发的美国次贷危机（并由此演变为全球金融危机）。\n这一判断主要来自中国康波周期研究的代表人物、中信建投前首席经济学家周金涛。他在2008年就提出，次贷危机是第五次康波衰退的“第一次冲击阶段”，并认为一次完整的康波衰退通常由两次冲击来完成，随后经济才会进入萧条阶段。‌￼‌￼\n📉 为什么是次贷危机？\n从康波划分来看，第五次康波的核心驱动力是信息技术革命，其繁荣期大约在1991年至2007年。2007年次贷危机苗头显现，2008年全面爆发并引发全球金融海啸，标志着由信息技术驱动的长波增长期动能耗尽，正式转入下行/衰退阶段。因此，这场危机被视为第五次康波衰退的第一波标志性冲击。\n🔄 补充：第二次冲击是什么？\n按照“两次冲击”的理论框架，第二次冲击大约发生在2014-2015年前后。周金涛在2015年指出，当时全球市场剧烈动荡（如新兴市场货币贬值、股市暴跌），本质是进入了康波衰退的“二次冲击阶段”。这一次冲击的核心特征，是此前全球大规模货币宽松的反危机效果达到边际高点，其创造的资产价格泡沫和币值泡沫开始面临释放压力。‌￼\n总结来说，第五次康波衰退的路径是：2008年次贷危机（第一次冲击）→ 2014-2015年全球动荡（第二次冲击）→ 此后逐步向萧条阶段过渡。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4423-4438", "abstract": "康波衰退向来以两次危机来完成。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 13, "chapterName": "08 康波衰退二次冲击正在靠近", "chapterIdx": 13, "reviewId": "3104481_8cWF4YxXY", "userVid": 3104481, "topics": [], "createTime": 1792312